Linux ATCPHY M3 Fabric calibration support

Adds an opt-in apple,t6031-atcphy Fabric window and tunable channel.
The legacy five-resource path remains unchanged; Fabric requires the sixth
resource named fabric and apple,tunable-fabric together.

Application: patch --batch --forward --fuzz=0 -p0 from the pinned source root.

